<title>JAPAN: Taiyo Yuden's shares bid-only on solid earnings.</title>
<headline>Taiyo Yuden's shares bid-only on solid earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiyo Yuden Co Ltd's shares were bid-only on Thursday morning, cheered by the firm's announcement of solid earnings on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>Shares of Taiyo Yuden, which makes electrolytic capacitors and ferrites, were bid-only at 1,630 yen, compared with Wednesday's close of 1,570.  </p>
<p>Taiyo Yuden said on Wednesday that its parent current profits increased to 7.34 billion yen for the year to March 31, 1997, from 6.18 billion yen a year earlier.</p>
